#: picture.slint:1383
msgid "Colour, Effects or Geometry (flip, rotation, crop/stretch) away from their defaults need the frames in memory, but upscaling needs them on the GPU. Reset them (Reset All) to upscale."
msgstr "色彩、效果或几何（翻转、旋转、裁剪/拉伸）不是默认值时，画面调节需要在内存中处理帧，而超分需要帧留在 GPU 上。将它们复位（全部复位）即可超分。"

#: picture.slint:1384
msgid "Deinterlace Always filters every frame in memory, but upscaling needs the frames on the GPU. Auto still deinterlaces interlaced video and lets it upscale."
msgstr "反交错为“总是使用”时，每一帧都在内存中处理，而超分需要帧留在 GPU 上。设为“自动”仍会对隔行视频反交错，并且可以超分。"

#: picture.slint:1385
msgid "Deinterlace Always and Colour, Effects or Geometry away from their defaults need the frames in memory, but upscaling needs them on the GPU. Turn off picture effects (or Reset All and set Deinterlace to Auto) to upscale."
msgstr "反交错为“总是使用”，且色彩、效果或几何不是默认值时，需要在内存中处理帧，而超分需要帧留在 GPU 上。关闭画面效果（或全部复位并将反交错设为“自动”）即可超分。"

#: picture.slint:1387
msgid "The video is decoded on the GPU, but its frames are copied to memory, and upscaling needs them on the GPU."
msgstr "视频在 GPU 上解码，但帧被复制到内存，而超分需要帧留在 GPU 上。"

#: picture.slint:1388
msgid "Hardware decoding is off, and upscaling needs the video decoded on the GPU."
msgstr "硬件解码已关闭，而超分需要视频在 GPU 上解码。"

#: picture.slint:1389
msgid "This video is decoded in software (for example a format the GPU does not decode), but upscaling needs it decoded on the GPU. Videos the GPU decodes are upscaled."
msgstr "此视频为软件解码（例如 GPU 不能解码的格式），而超分需要视频在 GPU 上解码。GPU 能解码的视频会被超分。"

#: picture.slint:1390
msgid "This video is decoded with another hardware decoder, and upscaling needs it decoded on the GPU that renders it."
msgstr "此视频使用另一种硬件解码器，而超分需要视频在渲染它的 GPU 上解码。"

